'''Flaming Fist''' are {{Epic}} [[Gloves]]. When equipped, melee attacks fire {{Gold|3 flaming fists}} that deal {{DamageType|fire|10,000}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Flaming Fist''' has a {{Green|0.5%}} chance to be dropped from the [[Barbarian Duke X]] if the player deals at least {{Stat|dmg|1,000,000}} to it.

