== Bugs ==
*Two of the three projectiles spawned by the '''Flaming Fist''' remain stationary.
*The '''Flaming Fist''' projectiles can be triggered by attacking another player, NPC, or Cosmetic on the {{zone|Private Island}}.  
**The projectiles will also trigger when the {{Item|Juju Shortbow}} hits an [[enderman]].
*The '''Flaming Fist''' projectiles count as bats for the {{Item|Bat Person Artifact}}.
*The '''Flaming Fist''' projectiles uses the {{Item|Very Crude Gabagool}} texture.
*The '''Flaming Fist''' reduces the hits required in the {{Zone|Belly of the Beast}} from three to one. This is due to each projectile counting as a hit.
*The '''Flaming Fist''' used to be able to damage {{Gamemode|Stranded}} Villagers on other players {{Zone|Private Island}}.

